      "messages": {
        "202430000": {
          "id": 202430000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，刚才我在海边，又收集到一些声音采样",
          "next": [
            202430001
          ]
        },
        "202430001": {
          "id": 202430001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "比如椰子滚落在地的声音，汽水满盈冒泡，铁板上滋滋作响的鱿鱼……",
          "next": [
            202430002
          ]
        },
        "202430002": {
          "id": 202430002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "对方正在输入中",
          "next": [
            202430003,
            202430005
          ]
        },
        "202430003": {
          "id": 202430003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "给我看饿了，想来两串鱿鱼",
          "next": [
            202430004
          ]
        },
        "202430004": {
          "id": 202430004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "其实我也……",
          "next": [
            202430006
          ]
        },
        "202430005": {
          "id": 202430005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这音乐真香…不是，这鱿鱼真好听",
          "next": [
            202430006
          ]
        },
        "202430006": {
          "id": 202430006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "哈哈，比起没有灵感时的大脑空空，感受味道的刺激，确实更精神了",
          "next": [
            202430007
          ]
        },
        "202430007": {
          "id": 202430007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "其实还有一些更有海边氛围的声音，你听",
          "next": [
            202430008
          ]
        },
        "202430008": {
          "id": 202430008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "这是海浪回退时：刷啦啦——咕噜咕噜咕噜咕噜——",
          "next": [
            202430009
          ]
        },
        "202430009": {
          "id": 202430009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成（识别到气泡音）",
          "next": [
            202430010
          ]
        },
        "202430010": {
          "id": 202430010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "海风穿过生锈的船锚：咻——嗡——咻——嗡——",
          "next": [
            202430011
          ]
        },
        "202430011": {
          "id": 202430011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成（识别到低音炮）",
          "next": [
            202430012
          ]
        },
        "202430012": {
          "id": 202430012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "海鸥飞过：沙沙——呼呼——咕咕——啊！",
          "next": [
            202430013
          ]
        },
        "202430013": {
          "id": 202430013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成（识别到鸟叫声）",
          "next": [
            202430014
          ]
        },
        "202430014": {
          "id": 202430014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "抱歉，那声「啊」是我…刚刚手上的零食被海鸥抢走了…",
          "next": [
            202430015
          ]
        },
        "202430015": {
          "id": 202430015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "现在采样数量已经够了，但总觉得还少了点…「直击心灵」的声音",
          "next": [
            202430016
          ]
        },
        "202430016": {
          "id": 202430016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}，或许你有能让人瞬间精神的声音灵感吗？",
          "next": [
            202430017,
            202430020,
            202430024
          ]
        },
        "202430017": {
          "id": 202430017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "听听列车跃迁时的轰鸣",
          "next": [
            202430018
          ]
        },
        "202430018": {
          "id": 202430018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "对方已接收附件「跃迁的轰鸣.mp3」",
          "next": [
            202430019
          ]
        },
        "202430019": {
          "id": 202430019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "代表「开拓」的声音，的确直击心灵",
          "next": [
            202430027
          ]
        },
        "202430020": {
          "id": 202430020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "听听起床的铃声吧",
          "next": [
            202430021
          ]
        },
        "202430021": {
          "id": 202430021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "对方已接收附件「清晨起床铃声.mp3」",
          "next": [
            202430022
          ]
        },
        "202430022": {
          "id": 202430022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "心脏骤停…也是一种直击心灵吧",
          "next": [
            202430023
          ]
        },
        "202430023": {
          "id": 202430023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "但为了听众们的身心健康，我可以降一个八度",
          "next": [
            202430027
          ]
        },
        "202430024": {
          "id": 202430024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "听听我的灵魂唱腔吧",
          "next": [
            202430025
          ]
        },
        "202430025": {
          "id": 202430025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "对方已接收附件「浴室高歌.mp3」",
          "next": [
            202430026
          ]
        },
        "202430026": {
          "id": 202430026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "这是你的歌声？的确很…直击心灵",
          "next": [
            202430027
          ]
        },
        "202430027": {
          "id": 202430027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "嗯…感觉可以简单合成试试！",
          "next": [
            202430028
          ]
        },
        "202430028": {
          "id": 202430028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Wing it now! Cast aside the unchanging score. Swing now! We aren't bolted parts anymore……",
          "next": [
            202430029
          ]
        },
        "202430029": {
          "id": 202430029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成（识别到原唱）",
          "next": [
            202430030
          ]
        },
        "202430030": {
          "id": 202430030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "《唯有追赶风的方向》remix版——有了「直击心灵」的采样和海风的伴奏，是不是更有夏日狂欢的氛围了？",
          "next": [
            202430031
          ]
        },
        "202430031": {
          "id": 202430031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "突然有灵感了，我回录音室一趟",
          "next": [
            202430032
          ]
        },
        "202430032": {
          "id": 202430032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "感谢你的奇思妙想！",
          "next": [
            202430033
          ]
        },
